---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const user = Astro.locals.user;
---
<BaseLayout user={user} seo={{ title: 'Terms of Service — CrossLinkd', description: 'Terms governing use of CrossLinkd.', path: '/terms' }}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm" style="color:var(--text-mute)">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--text-soft)">
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">1. A directory, not an endorsement.</strong> CrossLinkd is a discovery service. Inclusion, verification, or ranking never constitutes theological endorsement or denominational approval unless explicitly stated and independently verified.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">2. Accurate listings.</strong> You affirm that submissions are truthful, that you have the right to list or claim them, and that credentials and licenses you display are current.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">3. Respectful conduct.</strong> Reviews, comments, and messages must follow our Community Guidelines and Review Policy. Harassment, hate, spam, and misinformation are prohibited.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">4. Regulated professions.</strong> Counselors, healthcare providers, attorneys, financial professionals, and contractors must accurately represent licensure. We may display verification status and remove unverifiable claims.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">5. Youth safety.</strong> Listings serving minors must describe safeguarding practices on request and comply with applicable law.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">6. Content license.</strong> You grant us a license to display content you submit. You retain ownership and may request deletion per our Privacy Policy.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">7. Moderation.</strong> We may edit, suspend, or remove content that violates these terms, with notice and an appeals process.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">8. Limitation of liability.</strong> The service is provided “as is.” We are not liable for transactions or interactions between users and listings.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--text)">9. No fees right now.</strong> CrossLinkd does not charge for listings, claiming, verification, or accounts at this time, and we will never ask for payment details to publish a listing. If we ever introduce paid features, this section will be updated before any billing begins — and any sponsored placements will always be clearly labeled.</p>
      <p>Questions? <a href="/contact" class="underline">Contact us</a>. See also: <a href="/privacy" class="underline">Privacy</a>, <a href="/guidelines" class="underline">Guidelines</a>, <a href="/appeals" class="underline">Appeals</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
